[{"answer":"Before we start, Spiros and Hiroko,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/1.mp3"},{"answer":"thanks for coming in today to talk about your recent study experiences","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/2.mp3"},{"answer":"and congratulations to you both in doing so well in your first semester exams!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like to discuss with you the value of the English for Academic Purposes course you did here last year","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/4.mp3"},{"answer":"before starting your university course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Spiros, if I could start with you,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/6.mp3"},{"answer":"what parts of the programme have now proved to be particularly valuable to you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Um... I think that having to do a seminar presentation really helped me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/8.mp3"},{"answer":"For example, a couple of weeks ago in our marketing subject,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/9.mp3"},{"answer":"when it was my turn to give a presentation I felt quite confident.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course, I was still nervous but...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/11.mp3"},{"answer":"because I had done one before, I knew what to expect.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Also, I know I was well-prepared and I had practised my timing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/13.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, I think that in relation to some of the other people in my group,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I did quite a good job because my overall style was quite professional.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/15.mp3"},{"answer":"What about you, Hiroko?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Mmm, that's interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/17.mp3"},{"answer":"In my group, I was really surprised by the way the students did their presentations -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/18.mp3"},{"answer":"they just read their notes aloud!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you believe that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/20.mp3"},{"answer":"They didn't worry about their presentation style or keeping eye contact with their audience","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/21.mp3"},{"answer":"and I remember that these things were really stressed to us in the course here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/22.mp3"},{"answer":"So, how did you approach your presentation, Hiroko?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, to speak frankly, I read my notes too!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/24.mp3"},{"answer":"At the time, it was a relief to do it this way, but...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/25.mp3"},{"answer":"actually, when I had finished, I didn't feel any real sense of satisfaction.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I didn't feel positive about the experience at all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/27.mp3"},{"answer":"That's a pity.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/28.mp3"},{"answer":"You know, although I was pleased with my presentation,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I am not so pleased with my actual performance right now in the tutorials -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/30.mp3"},{"answer":"during the whole semester, I've not said anything in our tutorial discussions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Not a word.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Really, Spiros?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Why's that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Do the other students talk too much?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/35.mp3"},{"answer":"It's partly that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/36.mp3"},{"answer":"but it's mostly because I have had no confidence to speak out.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Their style of speaking is so different.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/38.mp3"},{"answer":"It's not the style we were used to during the course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/39.mp3"},{"answer":"They use so many colloquialisms,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/40.mp3"},{"answer":"they're not very polite and sometimes there seems to be no order in their discussion.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Also, they are very familiar with each other,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/42.mp3"},{"answer":"so because they know each other's habits,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/43.mp3"},{"answer":"they can let each other into the discussion.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/44.mp3"},{"answer":"You're right, Spiros, I've experienced that too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/45.mp3"},{"answer":"For most of this semester, I've said absolutely nothing in tutorials.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/46.mp3"},{"answer":"But recently, I've been trying to speak up more and I just jump in,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/47.mp3"},{"answer":"and I've noticed an interesting thing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/48.mp3"},{"answer":"I've noticed that if they thought my point was interesting or new,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/49.mp3"},{"answer":"then the next time they actually asked for my opinion,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/50.mp3"},{"answer":"and then it was much easier for me to be part of the discussion.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/51.mp3"},{"answer":"That's great, Hiroko!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/52.mp3"},{"answer":"I hope that happens for me next semester.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/53.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll have to work hard to find some interesting points.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/54.mp3"},{"answer":"What helped you to find these ideas?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I think that one thing that helped me with this was the reading.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/56.mp3"},{"answer":"I've had to do so much reading this semester just to help me make sense of the lectures.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/57.mp3"},{"answer":"At first, I couldn't understand what the lecturers were talking about,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/58.mp3"},{"answer":"so I had to turn to the books and journals.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Every night I read for hours,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/60.mp3"},{"answer":"using the lists of references that were given, and I made pages of notes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/61.mp3"},{"answer":"At breakfast, I read and read my notes again.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/62.mp3"},{"answer":"This habit has helped me to follow the ideas in the lectures,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/63.mp3"},{"answer":"and it's also given me some ideas to use in the tutorials.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/64.mp3"},{"answer":"But i did so much reading anyway.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/65.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think there's any time left over for anything extra.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/66.mp3"},{"answer":"My reading speed is still quite slow,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/67.mp3"},{"answer":"though I'm much better at dealing with vocabulary than I used to be.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/68.mp3"},{"answer":"What else do you think we could add to the course program to help with this reading problem?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/69.mp3"},{"answer":"There's not really anything because it's my problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/70.mp3"},{"answer":"I remember we were given long articles to read.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/71.mp3"},{"answer":"We didn't like that but now I realise that reading those long articles was good preparation for the things I need to read now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Also, in class, we regularly had speed-reading tasks to do,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/73.mp3"},{"answer":"and we kept a record of our reading speed,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/74.mp3"},{"answer":"so the teachers were encouraging us to work on that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/75.mp3"},{"answer":"That's true, Spiros,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/76.mp3"},{"answer":"but what we read could have been different.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes in the English class, I felt frustrated when I had to read articles about the environment or health or education,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/78.mp3"},{"answer":"because I wanted to concentrate on my own field,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/79.mp3"},{"answer":"but we didn't read anything about engineering.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/80.mp3"},{"answer":"So, I think I wasted some time learning vocabulary I didn't need.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm... but surely the strategies you were taught for dealing with that vocabulary were helpful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, but psychologically speaking,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/83.mp3"},{"answer":"I would have felt much better working on reading from my own field.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/84.mp3"},{"answer":"What do you think Spiros?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/85.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I agree, that would have helped my confidence too","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/86.mp3"},{"answer":"and I would have been more motivated.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/87.mp3"},{"answer":"It was good though that we could work on our own topics when we wrote the research assignments.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/88.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, let's move on to writing now...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-1-part-3-2023-07-22-18-12-48/89.mp3"}]
